@startuml MonteCarloSimuation_ClassDiagram

' ============================================================
' Monte Carlo Simulation System - Factory Pattern Architecture
' Python 3.12 | arch | ClickHouse | scipy | matplotlib
' ============================================================

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

package "MonteCarloSimuation" {

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Core Engine Layer
  ' ==========================================================
  class MonteCarloEngine {
    - returns: np.ndarray
    - params: dict
    - mu: float
    - sigma: float
    - distribution_type: str
    - sigma_type: str
    - n_series: int
    - alpha: float
    - t_param: float
    - distribution: Callable
    - distribution_params: dict
    --
    + __init__(returns: pd.Series, params: dict)
    + fit_distribution(): dict
    + calculate_sigma(): float
    + get_conditional_volatility(): np.ndarray | None
    + simulate_single_step(): np.ndarray
    + simulate_multi_step(times: int): np.ndarray
    + simulate_and_get_stats(times: int = None): dict | list
    - _fit_normal(): dict
    - _fit_student(): dict
    - _fit_skewed_t(): dict
    - _fit_lognormal(): dict
    - _fit_historical(): dict
    - _calc_normal_sigma(): float
    - _calc_garch_sigma(): float
    - _calc_egarch_sigma(): float
  }

  note right of MontecarloEngine
    <b>支持分布:</b>
    · normal  — 正态分布
    · student — Student-t
    · skewed-t — Hansen 偏态t
    · lognormal — 对数正态
    · history — 经验bootstrap

    <b>支持波动率:</b>
    · normal — 滚动标准差
    · garch  — GARCH(1,1)
    · egarch — EGARCH(1,1)
  end note

  class RiskMetrics {
    + {static} calculate_var(simulated_values, alpha): (float, float)
    + {static} calculate_es(simulated_values, alpha): (float, float)
    + {static} calculate_all_stats(simulated_values, alpha): dict
    - {static} _var_lower(values, alpha): float
    - {static} _var_upper(values, alpha): float
    - {static} _es_lower(values, alpha): float
    - {static} _es_upper(values, alpha): float
  }

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Analyzer Layer (Factory Pattern)
  ' ==========================================================
  abstract class BaseAssetAnalyzer {
    # symbol: str
    # start_date: str
    # end_date: str
    # analysis_column: str
    # analysis_column_label: str
    # limit_date: int
    # next_n_working_days: int
    # simulate_params: dict
    # raw_data: pd.DataFrame
    # calendar_data: pd.DataFrame
    --
    + {abstract} get_sql(symbol, start_date, end_date): str
    + {abstract} get_asset_name(): str
    + {static} _normalize_date(date_str): str
    + fetch_data(): pd.DataFrame
    + fetch_calendar(): pd.DataFrame
    + get_future_working_days(last_date, n): List[str]
    + get_analysis_returns(): pd.Series
    + run(): (pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame)
  }

  class GoldAnalyzer {
    -- 具体实现: COMEX黄金期货 --
    + get_sql(symbol, start_date, end_date): str
    + get_asset_name(): str
  }

  class AnalyzerFactory {
    - {static} _registry: dict
    --
    + {static} register(symbol: str, analyzer_class: type)
    + {static} create(symbol: str, **kwargs): BaseAssetAnalyzer
    + {static} list_registered(): list
  }

  note right of AnalyzerFactory
    <b>扩展新标的只需3步:</b>
    1. class SilverAnalyzer(BaseAssetAnalyzer)
    2. 实现 get_sql() 和 get_asset_name()
    3. AnalyzerFactory.register('SI', SilverAnalyzer)
  end note

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Result Aggregation Layer
  ' ==========================================================
  class ResultAggregator {
    + {static} compute_ema(series, periods): pd.DataFrame
    + {static} build_original_analysis(raw_data, risk_stats_list, ema_df, normal_segma, garch_segma, egarch_segma, step_num, analysis_column): pd.DataFrame
    + {static} build_prediction_results(dates, predict_values, analysis_column): pd.DataFrame
    + {static} merge_results(original_df, prediction_df): pd.DataFrame
  }

  note right of ResultAggregator
    <b>输出3个DataFrame:</b>
    1. 原始数据的分析 (21列)
    2. 预测结果的分析 (3列)
    3. 最终结果 (合并+排序)
  end note

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Backtest Layer
  ' ==========================================================
  class BacktestEngine {
    - symbol: str
    - test_start_date: str
    - test_end_date: str
    - alpha: float
    - limit_date: int
    - distribution_types: list
    - segma_calculation_type: str
    --
    + __init__(symbol, test_start_date, test_end_date, alpha, ...)
    + run_backtest(): dict
    + {static} kupiec_pof_test(violations, total, alpha): dict
    + {static} recommend_distribution(results): str
    + {static} plot_backtest_results(results)
    + {static} plot_var_violations(result, title)
  }

  note right of BacktestEngine
    <b>Kupiec POF 检验:</b>
    · 2026年测试期
    · 滚动窗口训练(limit_date天)
    · 遍历所有分布类型
    · 推荐最匹配的分布
    · H0: 实际击穿率 = alpha
    · LR_POF ~ χ²(1)
  end note

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Visualization Layer
  ' ==========================================================
  class Visualizer {
    + {static} plot_original_analysis(df, title, analysis_col_label)   <<图1>>
    + {static} plot_volatility_analysis(df, title)                      <<图2>>
    + {static} plot_prediction_results(df, title, analysis_col_label)   <<图3>>
    + {static} plot_final_results(df, title, analysis_col_label)        <<图4>>
    + {static} show_all(original_df, prediction_df, final_df, ...)
    - {static} _parse_dates(df): pd.Series
    - {static} _format_date_axis(ax, dates, is_datetime)
  }

  note bottom of Visualizer
    <b>4张图:</b>
    图1·原始数据分析 — trade_date(X), analysis_column(Y)
       VAR上下限, ES上下限, average, median
       EMA5, EMA10, EMA20, EMA60
    图2·波动率分析 — trade_date(X)
       normal_sigma, garch_sigma, egarch_sigma(Y)
    图3·预测结果分析 — trade_date(X)
       analysis_column(Y1), predict_value(Y2) 双Y轴
    图4·最终结果 — trade_date(X)
       历史analysis_column + 预测predict_value(Y)
       EGARCH sigma(Y1轴) 双Y轴
  end note

  ' ==========================================================
  '  Orchestrator
  ' ==========================================================
  class MonteCarloRunner {
    - symbol: str
    - start_date: str
    - end_date: str
    - analysis_column: str
    - analysis_column_label: str
    - limit_date: int
    - next_n_working_days: int
    - simulate_params: dict
    - _analyzer: BaseAssetAnalyzer
    - _original_df: pd.DataFrame
    - _prediction_df: pd.DataFrame
    - _final_df: pd.DataFrame
    --
    + __init__(symbol, start_date, end_date, ...)
    + initialize(): void
    + run_analysis(): (pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame)
    + export_to_excel(output_dir): void
    + run_and_export(output_dir): (pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame, pd.DataFrame)
    + run_backtest(test_start_date, test_end_date, distribution_types): dict
    + plot_all(): void
    + plot_original_analysis(): void
    + plot_volatility_analysis(): void
    + plot_prediction_results(): void
    + plot_final_results(): void
    - _build_filename(label, ext): str
  }

  note bottom of MonteCarloRunner
    <b>一键执行流程: run_and_export() → plot_all()</b>
    1. run_analysis()      → 蒙特卡罗模拟计算
    2. export_to_excel()   → 输出3个Excel到 outbound/
    3. plot_all()          → 绘制4张分析图

    <b>Excel命名:</b>
    Montcarlo_simulation_{标签}_{symbol}_{col}_{dist}_{sigma}_{start}_{end}.xlsx
    标签: 原始数据 | 预测结果 | 最终结果

    <b>回测流程:</b>
    run_backtest('2026-01-01','2026-12-31') → Kupiec检验 → 分布推荐
  end note

}

' ==========================================================
'  Relationships
' ==========================================================
BaseAssetAnalyzer <|-- GoldAnalyzer
AnalyzerFactory ..> BaseAssetAnalyzer : creates
AnalyzerFactory ..> GoldAnalyzer : registers

MonteCarloRunner --> AnalyzerFactory : creates via
MonteCarloRunner --> BaseAssetAnalyzer : delegates to
MonteCarloRunner --> MonteCarloEngine : uses
MonteCarloRunner --> RiskMetrics : uses
MonteCarloRunner --> ResultAggregator : uses
MonteCarloRunner --> Visualizer : plots via
MonteCarloRunner --> BacktestEngine : backtests via

BaseAssetAnalyzer --> MonteCarloEngine : creates
BaseAssetAnalyzer --> RiskMetrics : uses
BaseAssetAnalyzer --> ResultAggregator : uses

BacktestEngine --> BaseAssetAnalyzer : uses
BacktestEngine --> MonteCarloEngine : uses

MonteCarloEngine --> RiskMetrics : uses

' ==========================================================
'  Data flow (left to right)
' ==========================================================
note "Data Flow" as N1
  <b>数据流:</b>
  ClickHouse → BaseAssetAnalyzer.fetch_data()
  → MonteCarloEngine.fit_distribution() + simulate()
  → RiskMetrics → ResultAggregator → 3 DataFrames
  → export_to_excel() → Excel files
  → Visualizer → 4 charts
  → BacktestEngine → Kupiec test + recommendation
end note

@enduml
